        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="stage1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;isce3-rtc-get-data-for-scene-and-make-run-config&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Detect sensor mode (&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;IW&lt;/b&gt;/&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;EW&lt;/b&gt;) from the scene id and select the S1_RTC_{mode}.yaml / S1_RTC_STATIC_{mode}.yaml config template.&lt;br&gt;2. Find burst ids for the scene (query CDSE, fallback ASF); handle antimeridian-crossing geometry.&lt;br&gt;3. Check if burst products already exist in the GA S3 bucket → &lt;font color=&quot;#2D7D2D&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Success (100)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: early exit&lt;br&gt;4. If linking RTC_S1_STATIC layers, check they exist → else &lt;font color=&quot;#CC0000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process Failed (101)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: static layers missing&lt;br&gt;5. Download Scene + Orbit files from preferred sources (AUS_COP_HUB / ASF / CDSE) → timeout: &lt;font color=&quot;#CC0000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process Failed (102)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. Select + download DEM: REMA_32 (Antarctic) where available, else cop_glo30&lt;br&gt;8. Generate the RTC_S1 / RTC_S1_STATIC run-config YAML and save for the next stage&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="343" width="590" x="400" y="587" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="stage2Header" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" value="conda activate RTC" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="660" x="1050" y="547" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wtEKbDg2mfdxs0xIVsQH-10" edge="1" parent="1" source="stage2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#FF3333;" target="fail2Label">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wtEKbDg2mfdxs0xIVsQH-16" edge="1" parent="1" source="stage2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#009900;" target="stage3">
