        <mxCell id="stage3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;isce3-rtc-make-metadata-and-upload-bursts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Iterate through the burst products created in the previous stage&lt;br&gt;2. Get burst timing from CDSE; convert HDF5 metadata to STAC items&lt;br&gt;3. Build STAC .json, XML and checksum metadata files; link RTC_S1_STATIC assets if requested&lt;br&gt;4. Validate the STAC document (unless --skip-validate-stac)&lt;br&gt;5. Upload product files to the GA AWS S3 data bucket&lt;br&gt;6. Upload a processed-scene tracking file to the monitoring folder (unless skipped)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="343" width="520" x="1640" y="587" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
